    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now we now that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now using the above formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi